  unitName: Torch Eccentric Malef
  unitId: 10937
  unitNumber: 1435
  description: Although Malef accepted a deal with a female demon to save his life
    out of his obsession with his own research, current theories hold that he was
    motivated by more than just intellectual curiosity. It seems likely he held a
    grudge against his fellow researcher, or perhaps even more complicated emotions.
    Had he continued to work alongside his partner without allowing those feelings
    to fester, he might have succeeded in achieving the ultimate goal of his research.
  summonDesc: The truth...still so far off! The "ultimate being," still so far off!
    I will create it, with these hands!
  fusionDesc: And that's one more step closer to the truth. It seems that my genius
    has moved even a fool like you!
  evoDesc: My lust for research is ablaze! I don't have time for petty concerns;
    not when I'm creating the "ultimate being!"
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
